PAL16L8
GENE1
Genesis Interrupt PAL
Scott Statton, Developer Resources,Mtn. View, CA

NMI FC0 FC1 FC2 A1 A2 A3 PIN8 PIN9 GND
PIN11 IPL0 Q NOTQ S R PIN17 IPL1 IPL2 VCC

/S = FC0 * FC1 * FC2 * A1 * A2 * A3

/R = /NMI * /NOTQ

/Q = NOTQ * S

/NOTQ = Q * R

IF ( VCC ) /IPL0 = /Q

IF ( /Q ) /IPL1 = VCC

IF ( /Q ) /IPL2 = VCC


FUNCTION TABLE

NMI FC0 FC1 FC2 A1 A2 A3 IPL0 IPL1 IPL2 S R Q NOTQ
; N  F  F  F          | I  I  I
; M  C  C  C  A  A  A | P  P  P       N
; I  0  1  2  1  2  3 | 0  1  2 S R Q Q


; test s,r,ipl's,Q,NOTQ
;  H  X  X  X  X  X  X   X  X  X X H L H
;  L  X  X  X  X  X  X   X  X  X X H L H
